	(text "R10 single screw switch (owner 2026-10-28): J400 powers and arms the board; J124 is removed. Q120/Q121 remain the pyro-bus load switch feeding RAW_ACT."
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 83127760-6cb2-56c5-a73d-92d39a229209))
	(text "PC1 (U1.16) drives ACT_EN_MCU through R122 1k to Q122; R123 100k holds Q122 off in reset or unpowered. Q124 uses a separate MCU fire pin and its retained gate network."
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 873aaf0c-ec31-581c-b038-72788d10ea03))
	(text "AUD-3: Q120/Q121 AONR21357, C120 1uF 25V X7R. Hold PE4 low and wait >=100 ms after ACT_EN before bus checks or any permitted fire; hot resistance and turn-on SOA remain bench qualifications."
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 7277bbaf-c52c-5d00-8f90-b09edb6bdeae))
	(text "C121 removed; servos use external pack power and return. RAW_ACT feeds R134 and both retained bus-sense dividers; no feed directly from BAT_IN or RAW_PROTECTED."
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid e379a682-3ef2-58c6-a879-d5cbff021361))
	(text "R134 limits a shorted igniter; normal physical fire current <=20 ms. Firmware timing and pulse qualification: sources/r10_design/parts_qualification.md; no firmware implemented."
		(at 20.32 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid e795d07f-117b-513a-aa8d-555acc2ba3aa))
